                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000001",
      "key": "a7010006-5555-4555-8555-111100000008",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "html",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<!--\n  CENTRO CCW LAS VEGAS 2026 FULL DYNAMIC BLOG BODY\n\n  WORDPRESS PLACEMENT\n  1. Keep the existing page title, featured image, category, view count and sidebar.\n  2. Remove the current article body.\n  3. Add one WordPress “Custom HTML” block and paste this entire file.\n\n  CSS and native HTML only. No JavaScript is required.\n-->\n\n<style>\n  .centro-ccw-report,\n  .centro-ccw-report * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .centro-ccw-report {\n    --ccw-steel: #015376;\n    --ccw-blue: #0788bd;\n    --ccw-electric: #26b7e6;\n    --ccw-sky: #78d7ed;\n    --ccw-aqua: #c8f4fa;\n    --ccw-ink: #071c2c;\n    --ccw-navy: #0d2d43;\n    --ccw-text: #344f63;\n    --ccw-muted: #607989;\n    --ccw-soft: #eaf7fc;\n    --ccw-line: rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.13);\n    width: 100%;\n    color: var(--ccw-text);\n    font-family: \"Poppins\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .centro-ccw-report h2,\n  .centro-ccw-report h3,\n  .centro-ccw-report p,\n  .centro-ccw-report summary {\n    font-family: \"Poppins\", Arial, sans-serif !important;\n  }\n\n  .centro-ccw-report a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-kicker {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel) !important;\n    font-size: 10.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-kicker::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 27px;\n    height: 3px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ccw-steel), var(--ccw-electric));\n  }\n\n  .ccw-section-title {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 37px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    line-height: 1.14 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-section-copy {\n    margin: 13px 0 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 14.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* FIELD REPORT HERO */\n  .ccw-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 16%, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.22), transparent 26%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 95%, rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.14), transparent 32%),\n      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ccw-ink), var(--ccw-navy));\n    box-shadow: 0 28px 65px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.28);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -2;\n    inset: 0;\n    opacity: 0.22;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.65) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 22px 22px;\n    mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 55%, #000);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    top: -115px;\n    right: -90px;\n    width: 330px;\n    height: 330px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.15);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow:\n      0 0 0 40px rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.035),\n      0 0 0 80px rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.025);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__topline {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 22px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__code,\n  .ccw-hero__status {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__status {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 7px;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__status::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.10), 0 0 14px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.75);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__body {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.16fr) minmax(230px, 0.84fr);\n    gap: 30px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 42px 36px 34px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__label {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    color: var(--ccw-sky);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.17em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__label::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 2px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.55);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__title {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    font-size: clamp(31px, 5vw, 47px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    line-height: 1.04 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__title span {\n    color: var(--ccw-sky);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__copy {\n    margin: 18px 0 0 !important;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__meta {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-top: 23px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-hero__meta span {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  /* RADAR */\n  .ccw-radar {\n    display: grid;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 300px;\n    place-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__field {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 248px;\n    height: 248px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.25);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.10) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.10) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.10), transparent 64%);\n    background-size: 31px 31px, 31px 31px, auto;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 42px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.08), 0 0 35px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.08);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__field::before,\n  .ccw-radar__field::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.18);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__field::before {\n    inset: 37px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__field::after {\n    inset: 78px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__axis-x,\n  .ccw-radar__axis-y {\n    position: absolute;\n    background: rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.16);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__axis-x {\n    top: 50%;\n    right: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    height: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__axis-y {\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 50%;\n    width: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__sweep {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    width: 50%;\n    height: 50%;\n    border-left: 1px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.50);\n    background: linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.28), transparent 70%);\n    transform-origin: 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__center {\n    display: grid;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 4;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    width: 72px;\n    height: 72px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--ccw-blue), var(--ccw-steel));\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.08), 0 13px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 5;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.22);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua);\n    background: rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.82);\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);\n    font-size: 8px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.95);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--ai {\n    top: 27px;\n    right: 29px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--ai::before {\n    right: -16px;\n    bottom: -8px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--data {\n    right: 5px;\n    bottom: 50px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--data::before {\n    bottom: -13px;\n    left: -11px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--people {\n    bottom: 35px;\n    left: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--people::before {\n    top: -17px;\n    right: -9px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--journey {\n    top: 48px;\n    left: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-radar__node--journey::before {\n    right: -17px;\n    bottom: -5px;\n  }\n\n  /* EVENT SCALE */\n  .ccw-scale {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 1px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-scale__item {\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n    background: rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.90);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-scale__item strong {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua);\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 38px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-scale__item span {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    letter-spacing: 0.09em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  /* MOVING SIGNAL TICKER */\n  .ccw-ticker {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 0 48px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 9px 28px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.07);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker::before,\n  .ccw-ticker::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 2;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 45px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker::before {\n    left: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, transparent);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker::after {\n    right: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(-90deg, #ffffff, transparent);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker__track {\n    display: flex;\n    width: max-content;\n    padding: 12px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker__group {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker__group span {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel);\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.10em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-ticker__group span::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.10);\n  }\n\n  /* CENTRAL THESIS */\n  .ccw-thesis {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 48px 0;\n    padding: 36px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 94% 5%, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.18), transparent 28%),\n      linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff 0%, #f2fbfe 100%);\n    box-shadow: 0 22px 55px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.09);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-thesis::after {\n    content: \"“\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    top: -38px;\n    right: 18px;\n    color: rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.055);\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 190px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-thesis__label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    color: var(--ccw-blue);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.17em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-thesis h2 {\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    font-size: clamp(29px, 5vw, 43px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.045em;\n    line-height: 1.08 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-thesis h2 span {\n    color: var(--ccw-blue);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-thesis p {\n    max-width: 650px;\n    margin: 17px 0 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 14.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* RESEARCH PULSE */\n  .ccw-pulse {\n    margin: 48px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 13px;\n    margin-top: 27px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 240px;\n    padding: 22px 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 19px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.08);\n    transition: transform 250ms ease, border-color 250ms ease, box-shadow 250ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -44px;\n    bottom: -48px;\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 120px;\n    border: 18px solid var(--ccw-soft);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.40);\n    box-shadow: 0 19px 42px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.14);\n    transform: translateY(-7px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card__ring {\n    display: grid;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    width: 82px;\n    height: 82px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 7px solid var(--ccw-soft);\n    border-top-color: var(--ccw-electric);\n    border-right-color: var(--ccw-blue);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel);\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 9px 24px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.11);\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card h3 {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 0 8px !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.35 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card p {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 11.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.65 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-pulse-card__source {\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin-top: 13px;\n    padding: 5px 8px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel);\n    background: var(--ccw-soft);\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  /* FIVE SIGNALS */\n  .ccw-signals {\n    margin: 50px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signals__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 225px;\n    padding: 21px 19px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.07);\n    transition: color 260ms ease, background 260ms ease, border-color 260ms ease, box-shadow 260ms ease, transform 260ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:nth-child(1),\n  .ccw-signal:nth-child(2) {\n    grid-column: span 3;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:nth-child(3),\n  .ccw-signal:nth-child(4),\n  .ccw-signal:nth-child(5) {\n    grid-column: span 2;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ccw-steel), var(--ccw-electric));\n    transform: scaleX(0.22);\n    transform-origin: left;\n    transition: transform 300ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -45px;\n    bottom: -48px;\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 120px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ccw-soft);\n    transition: transform 300ms ease, background 300ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.32);\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--ccw-steel), var(--ccw-ink));\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 42px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.20);\n    transform: translateY(-7px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover::before {\n    transform: scaleX(1);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover::after {\n    background: rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.09);\n    transform: scale(1.3);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal__number {\n    display: inline-block;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    color: var(--ccw-blue);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.13em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal h3 {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    font-size: 17px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n    transition: color 260ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal p {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.7 !important;\n    transition: color 260ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover .ccw-signal__number {\n    color: var(--ccw-sky);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover h3 {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-signal:hover p {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.70) !important;\n  }\n\n  /* PROMISE VS REALITY */\n  .ccw-reality {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 50px 0;\n    padding: 35px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 5%, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.23), transparent 28%),\n      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ccw-ink), var(--ccw-navy));\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 58px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.24);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    inset: 0;\n    opacity: 0.14;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.28) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 100% 46px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality .ccw-kicker {\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua) !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality .ccw-kicker::before {\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality .ccw-section-title {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality .ccw-section-copy {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.70) !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__labels,\n  .ccw-reality__row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 42px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__labels {\n    margin-top: 27px;\n    padding: 0 15px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__labels span {\n    color: var(--ccw-sky);\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__labels span:last-child {\n    grid-column: 3;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__row {\n    padding: 13px 15px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    transition: background 230ms ease, border-color 230ms ease, transform 230ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__row:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.30);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n    transform: translateX(4px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__promise,\n  .ccw-reality__requirement {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__promise {\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__requirement {\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-reality__arrow {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    margin: auto;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua);\n    background: rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.12);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* CX OPERATING SYSTEM */\n  .ccw-os {\n    margin: 50px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-os__frame {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    padding: 32px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f4fbfe);\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.09);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-os__header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    padding-bottom: 13px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-os__header strong,\n  .ccw-os__header span {\n    color: var(--ccw-steel);\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-os__header span {\n    color: var(--ccw-muted);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-os__stack {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 0.55fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n    gap: 14px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.10);\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.05);\n    transition: border-color 240ms ease, box-shadow 240ms ease, transform 240ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.35);\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.11);\n    transform: translateX(7px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer__icon {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--ccw-steel), var(--ccw-blue));\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.18);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer__icon svg {\n    width: 21px;\n    height: 21px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer h3 {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.35 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-layer p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 11.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.6 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* LEADER QUESTIONS */\n  .ccw-questions {\n    margin: 50px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 27px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion details {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ccw-line);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.06);\n    transition: border-color 240ms ease, box-shadow 240ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion details[open] {\n    border-color: rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.38);\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.11);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    color: var(--ccw-ink) !important;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 14.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.4 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion summary::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ccw-electric);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.11);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    display: grid;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 29px;\n    height: 29px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel);\n    background: var(--ccw-soft);\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transition: transform 230ms ease, color 230ms ease, background 230ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion details[open] summary::after {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: var(--ccw-steel);\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion__body {\n    padding: 0 58px 20px 43px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-accordion__body p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--ccw-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.75 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* CENTRO PERSPECTIVE + CTA */\n  .ccw-centro {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 50px 0 0;\n    padding: 36px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 5%, rgba(38, 183, 230, 0.28), transparent 29%),\n      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ccw-steel), var(--ccw-ink));\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 58px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.23);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro::after {\n    content: \"CENTRO\";\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    right: -16px;\n    bottom: -28px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);\n    font-size: clamp(76px, 16vw, 132px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -0.07em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: 0.17em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro h2 {\n    max-width: 650px;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    font-size: clamp(27px, 4.5vw, 39px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    line-height: 1.12 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro p {\n    max-width: 660px;\n    margin: 15px 0 0 !important;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) !important;\n    font-size: 13.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__actions {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 12px 15px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n    border-radius: 11px;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    transition: color 220ms ease, background 220ms ease, border-color 220ms ease, box-shadow 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button::after {\n    content: \"→\";\n    opacity: 0.65;\n    transition: opacity 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button:hover,\n  .ccw-centro__button:focus-visible {\n    border-color: #ffffff;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel) !important;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 13px 28px rgba(7, 28, 44, 0.24);\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button:hover::after,\n  .ccw-centro__button:focus-visible::after {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateX(3px);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button--primary {\n    border-color: #ffffff;\n    color: var(--ccw-steel) !important;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-centro__button:focus-visible {\n    outline: 3px solid rgba(120, 215, 237, 0.45);\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua) !important;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 10.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    line-height: 1.4 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    margin-left: auto;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    transition: transform 220ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources[open] summary::after {\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources__body {\n    padding: 0 17px 17px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources__body ol {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 19px;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources__body li {\n    margin: 0 0 9px;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.60);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources__body li:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ccw-sources__body a {\n    color: var(--ccw-aqua) !important;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* MOTION */\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n    .ccw-hero,\n    .ccw-thesis,\n    .ccw-pulse,\n    .ccw-signals,\n    .ccw-reality,\n    .ccw-os,\n    .ccw-questions,\n    .ccw-centro {\n      animation: ccwReveal 700ms both;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-radar__sweep {\n      animation: ccwRadar 5.8s linear infinite;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-radar__node::before,\n    .ccw-hero__status::before {\n      animation: ccwPulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-ticker__track {\n      animation: ccwTicker 24s linear infinite;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-pulse-card__ring {\n      animation: ccwRing 8s linear infinite;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-signal:nth-child(2),\n    .ccw-pulse-card:nth-child(2) {\n      animation-delay: 110ms;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-signal:nth-child(3),\n    .ccw-pulse-card:nth-child(3) {\n      animation-delay: 220ms;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-signal,\n    .ccw-pulse-card {\n      animation: ccwReveal 620ms both;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes ccwReveal {\n    from {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(17px);\n    }\n    to {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes ccwRadar {\n    to {\n      transform: rotate(360deg);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes ccwPulse {\n    0%,\n    100% {\n      opacity: 0.55;\n      transform: scale(0.9);\n    }\n    50% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: scale(1.18);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes ccwTicker {\n    to {\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes ccwRing {\n    to {\n      transform: rotate(360deg);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .ccw-hero__body,\n    .ccw-scale,\n    .ccw-pulse__grid,\n    .ccw-reality__labels,\n    .ccw-reality__row {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-hero__body,\n    .ccw-thesis,\n    .ccw-reality,\n    .ccw-os__frame,\n    .ccw-centro {\n      padding: 25px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-hero,\n    .ccw-thesis,\n    .ccw-reality,\n    .ccw-os__frame,\n    .ccw-centro {\n      border-radius: 21px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-radar {\n      min-height: 270px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-radar__field {\n      width: 225px;\n      height: 225px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-scale {\n      gap: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-signals__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-signal:nth-child(n) {\n      grid-column: auto;\n      min-height: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__labels {\n      display: none;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__row {\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__promise::before,\n    .ccw-reality__requirement::before {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      color: var(--ccw-sky);\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__promise::before {\n      content: \"The promise\";\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__requirement::before {\n      content: \"The operating requirement\";\n    }\n\n    .ccw-reality__arrow {\n      margin: 2px 0;\n      transform: rotate(90deg);\n    }\n\n    .ccw-layer {\n      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-layer p {\n      grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-accordion__body {\n      padding-right: 20px;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ccw-centro__button {\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"centro-ccw-report\">\n  <section class=\"ccw-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-hero-title\">\n    <div class=\"ccw-hero__topline\">\n      <span class=\"ccw-hero__code\">CX Intelligence Report // LV-2026</span>\n      <span class=\"ccw-hero__status\">Signal Active</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-hero__body\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"ccw-hero__label\">What We Heard at CCW Las Vegas 2026</span>\n        <h2 class=\"ccw-hero__title\" id=\"ccw-hero-title\">\n          The Future of CX Is Built on <span>Better Operations</span>\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"ccw-hero__copy\">\n          Across conversations with customer experience, contact center, and technology leaders, one message kept returning: new tools matter, but the quality of execution determines whether customers feel the difference.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"ccw-hero__copy\">\n          AI, automation, and analytics create possibilities. Connected workflows, prepared teams, reliable handoffs, and operational visibility turn those possibilities into performance.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"ccw-hero__meta\" aria-label=\"Event details\">\n          <span>June 22–25, 2026</span>\n          <span>Caesars Forum</span>\n          <span>Las Vegas</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ccw-radar\" aria-label=\"Customer experience operations signal map\">\n        <div class=\"ccw-radar__field\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__axis-x\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__axis-y\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__sweep\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__center\">OPS</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--ai\">AI</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--data\">Data</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--people\">People</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--journey\">Journey</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-scale\" aria-label=\"CCW Las Vegas event scale\">\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>5,000+</strong>\n        <span>Attendees</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>54%</strong>\n        <span>Fortune 100 Represented</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>181+</strong>\n        <span>Programming Hours</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"ccw-ticker\" aria-label=\"Key CCW themes\">\n    <div class=\"ccw-ticker__track\">\n      <div class=\"ccw-ticker__group\">\n        <span>AI Needs Orchestration</span>\n        <span>Better Handoffs</span>\n        <span>Visibility Before Automation</span>\n        <span>Human Judgment Matters</span>\n        <span>Operations Create Consistency</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-ticker__group\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span>AI Needs Orchestration</span>\n        <span>Better Handoffs</span>\n        <span>Visibility Before Automation</span>\n        <span>Human Judgment Matters</span>\n        <span>Operations Create Consistency</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-thesis\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-thesis-title\">\n    <span class=\"ccw-thesis__label\">The Strongest Signal</span>\n    <h2 id=\"ccw-thesis-title\">AI May Change the Interface. <span>Operations Decide the Outcome.</span></h2>\n    <p>\n      CCW made the gap between innovation and execution impossible to ignore. Customers do not experience a strategy deck, a technology roadmap, or an AI pilot. They experience the answer, the handoff, the resolution, and whether the organization remembers what already happened.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      The strongest CX organizations will be the ones that connect technology to everyday operating discipline instead of treating transformation as a collection of isolated tools.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-pulse\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-pulse-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">2026 Research Pulse</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-pulse-title\">Customers Want Automation and Human Access</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      The operational challenge is not choosing between people and AI. It is designing journeys that use each where it creates the most value and move between them without losing context.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-pulse__grid\">\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">75%</span>\n        <h3>Prefer Self-Service for Simple Needs</h3>\n        <p>Customers are comfortable using AI and self-service when the request is routine and the path to resolution is clear.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">87%</span>\n        <h3>Want the Phone When It Gets Complicated</h3>\n        <p>Complex, sensitive, or high-effort situations still create strong demand for direct access to a person.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">45%</span>\n        <h3>Rep Time Focused on Customer Support</h3>\n        <p>Frontline capacity is consumed by the work around the interaction, making better systems and workflows essential.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-signals\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-signals-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">Field Notes</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-signals-title\">Five Signals That Cut Through the Noise</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      The event floor was full of technology, but the most important conversations focused on how that technology becomes usable, accountable, and valuable inside real customer operations.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-signals__grid\">\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 01</span>\n        <h3>AI Is Moving Beyond Experimentation</h3>\n        <p>Leaders are asking less about whether to use AI and more about where it belongs, what it should decide, and how its performance will be governed.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 02</span>\n        <h3>Human Judgment Is the Escalation Layer</h3>\n        <p>Automation works best when the organization has intentionally designed when context, emotion, risk, or complexity should move the interaction to a person.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 03</span>\n        <h3>Agent Enablement Is CX Infrastructure</h3>\n        <p>Better knowledge, guidance, and visibility help frontline teams make stronger decisions without adding unnecessary customer effort.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 04</span>\n        <h3>Connected Data Comes Before Personalization</h3>\n        <p>Personalization breaks down when customer history is fragmented, systems disagree, or channels cannot carry context forward.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 05</span>\n        <h3>Operational Control Makes Scale Possible</h3>\n        <p>Quality assurance, workforce planning, reporting, and structured improvement loops remain the foundation of consistent service at scale.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-reality\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-reality-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">From Hype to Execution</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-reality-title\">Every CX Promise Has an Operating Requirement</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      Technology can accelerate performance, but only when the operating model underneath it is ready.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-reality__labels\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span>The Promise</span>\n      <span>The Operating Requirement</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccw-reality__grid\">\n      <div class=\"ccw-reality__row\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__promise\">AI-powered personalization</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__requirement\">Unified data, clear permissions, and decision governance</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-reality__row\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__promise\">Omnichannel service</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__requirement\">Context that travels between channels and teams</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-reality__row\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__promise\">Faster automation</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__requirement\">Well-designed escalation paths and exception handling</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-reality__row\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__promise\">Real-time analytics</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__requirement\">Owners who can translate signals into action</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-reality__row\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__promise\">More agent productivity</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"ccw-reality__requirement\">Better tools, knowledge, coaching, and workflow design</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-os\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-os-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">The CX Operating System</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-os-title\">Four Layers That Make Better Experiences Repeatable</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      CX becomes reliable when people, process, technology, and measurement reinforce one another instead of operating as separate initiatives.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-os__frame\">\n      <div class=\"ccw-os__header\">\n        <strong>Centro // CX Operations Stack</strong>\n        <span>Connected for Performance</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-os__stack\">\n        <article class=\"ccw-layer\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-layer__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\" /><path d=\"M3.5 19c.5-4 2.2-6 5.5-6s5 2 5.5 6M16 7h4M18 5v4\" />\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <h3>People</h3>\n          <p>Prepared teams, clear ownership, coaching, and human judgment where complexity requires it.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"ccw-layer\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-layer__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <path d=\"M4 6h7v5H4zM13 13h7v5h-7zM11 8.5h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2V13\" />\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <h3>Process</h3>\n          <p>Designed handoffs, defined exceptions, knowledge flows, and workflows that reduce customer effort.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"ccw-layer\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-layer__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" /><path d=\"M8 9h8M8 13h5M8 17h8\" />\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <h3>Technology</h3>\n          <p>Connected platforms, responsible automation, usable data, and tools that support the frontline.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"ccw-layer\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-layer__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n              <path d=\"M5 19V9M10 19V5M15 19v-7M20 19V8\" /><path d=\"m4 7 6-4 5 5 5-4\" />\n            </svg>\n          </span>\n          <h3>Measurement</h3>\n          <p>Operational metrics connected to resolution quality, customer outcomes, retention, and business value.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-questions\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-questions-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">What Leaders Should Ask Next</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-questions-title\">Turn the Conversation Into an Operating Agenda</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      The most useful next step is not adding another tool. It is identifying where the current customer operation loses context, time, quality, or accountability.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-accordion\">\n      <details open>\n        <summary>Where does customer context break today?</summary>\n        <div class=\"ccw-accordion__body\">\n          <p>Map the moments where customers repeat information, channels fail to carry history, or departments work from different versions of the same story.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Which decisions should AI support, and which should remain human?</summary>\n        <div class=\"ccw-accordion__body\">\n          <p>Separate routine, rules-based activity from situations involving judgment, emotion, risk, or complex exceptions. Then design clear transitions between them.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Do frontline teams have enough visibility to resolve the issue?</summary>\n        <div class=\"ccw-accordion__body\">\n          <p>Review the systems, knowledge, permissions, and guidance agents need during the interaction, not only what managers can see afterward.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Are CX metrics connected to business outcomes?</summary>\n        <div class=\"ccw-accordion__body\">\n          <p>Move beyond isolated service metrics by connecting operational performance to retention, repeat contact, cost, conversion, and customer value.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Can the operating model scale without losing quality?</summary>\n        <div class=\"ccw-accordion__body\">\n          <p>Test whether governance, workforce planning, quality assurance, reporting, and improvement loops remain reliable as demand, channels, and markets grow.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ccw-centro\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-centro-title\">\n    <span class=\"ccw-centro__label\">The Centro Perspective</span>\n    <h2 id=\"ccw-centro-title\">Better CX Is Built in the Handoffs Customers Never See</h2>\n    <p>\n      The conversations at CCW reinforced a principle that shapes Centro’s approach to Contact Center Outsourcing and digital transformation: strategy becomes real through execution. The strongest experience is created when talent, workflows, technology, reporting, and accountability work together across every interaction.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Centro helps organizations strengthen that operating layer so they can improve service quality, expand capacity, modernize customer operations, and adopt new technology with greater control.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-centro__actions\">\n      <a class=\"ccw-centro__button\" href=\"https://centrocdx.com/bpo/\">Contact Center Outsourcing</a>\n      <a class=\"ccw-centro__button\" href=\"https://centrocdx.com/digital/\">Digital Transformation</a>\n      <a class=\"ccw-centro__button ccw-centro__button--primary\" href=\"https://centrocdx.com/get-in-touch/\">Talk to Centro</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <details class=\"ccw-sources\">\n      <summary>Sources and Further Reading</summary>\n      <div class=\"ccw-sources__body\">\n        <ol>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.customermanagementpractice.com/cmp-events/ccw/las-vegas/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Customer Management Practice, CCW Las Vegas event overview and attendee profile</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.webex.com/us/en/live-events/ccw-2026.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cisco Webex, CCW 2026 event information, June 22–25, 2026</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.servicenow.com/workflow/crm/cx-shift-study-expectations-ai-era.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ServiceNow, The CX Shift: A Study of Customer Expectations in the AI Era, 2026</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://cresta.com/blog/recap-cresta-at-ccw-las-vegas-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cresta, CCW Las Vegas 2026 event recap</a></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
