    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[From June 22 to 25, thousands of customer experience leaders, contact center operators, technology providers, and outsourcing partners gathered at Caesars Forum for Customer Contact Week Las Vegas 2026.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
